        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-31T10:18:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Had an interesting game today. With Rooftop Combat in play, all damage increased by 1 effectively negates Advance mode damage reduction of 1. Meanwhile, environment cards cannot be played until Rooftop Combat is destroyed. With Dark Visionary using Turmoil to prevent Disrupt the Field from being played, the heroes simply took their time to tear down AB Limb by Limb.</p>",
